{"job_id":"F-4753517fc1d52cf39a75","family_id":"F-4753517fc1d52cf39a75","title":"민사소송비용법","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001197-130808-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":7,"target_id":"d1291d186f07e6b33fd86252a6701a072aaad0749d47d91581f4c4f4cd391d1a","source_hash":"2d8d3ef1df3b2bf64dbf7c97e8e5090db01d482bbc35f45270af232a03c2252a","text":"民事诉讼费用法"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001197-130808-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":78,"target_id":"5f470e29cc791c11bf39fff85fc4df088c4214b5d4221d1783959383e2eb3dec","source_hash":"f82fc6831107239a83b5e360dc493d047dfba43168ab6154b418045a517692b2","text":"第一条（诉讼费用的目的） 按照《民事诉讼法》的规定，诉讼费用应当限于进行诉讼行为所必需的范围，并按照下列条款的规定计算。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001197-130808-ko","scope":"BODY","start":78,"end":149,"target_id":"7e532050fe5755e3fed12ce661eb9f101dc7dc688c15fc274f26b03add4e4f9a","source_hash":"4f444cb942327fe2ca94b14fe74257f8c0e6ad1283cc363c08618dc8093989c1","text":"第二条（印花税）依民事诉讼等印花税法征收的印花税，按规定数额征收。<1997年12月13日、2012年12月18日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001197-130808-ko","scope":"BODY","start":149,"end":212,"target_id":"4ab3d6cf4e1aeacec6aa659c2b9ad2fe10556afae23a88176a91f4d0650013c4","source_hash":"c26e017ec8d0d3a309b27bb67cead84775c4c7011153a6a4782618b7c4045b71","text":"第三条（文书费等）诉讼文书的文书费和绘图的文书费，按照最高法院规则规定的数额收取。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001197-130808-ko","scope":"BODY","start":212,"end":386,"target_id":"10908796c7cf8f5dab1e87e219817f62dcfa8c93743eeb60a6b4ce09f1744a15","source_hash":"3659f3513e64ab574bb0fd9574f4308ad39c117a3c38063b5a74009868b6e952","text":"第四条（证人、专家等人员的每日津贴、差旅费等）  当事人、证人、专家证人、口译员和笔译员的每日津贴由法院或受托法官确定，但不得超过每日70韩元；差旅费按火车或轮船二等舱车票或运费标准计算，陆路（无火车）每4公里5韩元，每晚240韩元。<1962年7月31日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001197-130808-ko","scope":"BODY","start":386,"end":490,"target_id":"ce9f435e9f8a34c2e25147be397775a47b3369aca9e418a919637514ddef0d39","source_hash":"ecb5adc03446463b5bbed0107864dca7b471d3ce73207cec9b3a7666ee2a8d51","text":"第五条（法官等人员的每日津贴和差旅费）\n① 法官和法庭书记员审查证据所需的每日津贴、差旅费和住宿费，应按实际费用计算。\n② 前款规定实际发生的费用以及实施该款规定所必需的事项，由最高法院规则确定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001197-130808-ko","scope":"BODY","start":490,"end":550,"target_id":"fcb87fe48032e72e35b5abec11d0fc707d44ba1c720205d899d1f21f5dba0098","source_hash":"792a675e2e26f0c63fdb7ad00ff7e4fe7f82345bb1bf8ce73bbb256d9e31fd6f","text":"第六条（评估等特别费用）评估、口译、笔译和勘测的特别费用，由法院确定数额。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001197-130808-ko","scope":"BODY","start":550,"end":587,"target_id":"b6f3cac3bd3789dc348a3336aeb365aa49c53c16d5d2ca0ac8a81c69b78c937f","source_hash":"8f0da902065ed7ea60a7b705e736886b7dd577cc49c119567a9693cfc8a68ddd","text":"第七条（通讯费用）通讯和交通所需的费用应当按实际成本计算。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001197-130808-ko","scope":"BODY","start":587,"end":625,"target_id":"0d690a99ffda671c8898569f0da14d2a87923a3258382c89d9cbcc2e6b7052a3","source_hash":"f40598e248caf83cad7227a987d4926d4c5bc6717fb7be2ce45dff8640b59e3e","text":"第八条（出版费用）在官方公报和报纸上发表文章的费用按固定费率计算。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001197-130808-ko","scope":"BODY","start":625,"end":666,"target_id":"bad6adb4bf16d8c1d552d60462b5cf89145587a9a2ce2f0338879aa9bae77976","source_hash":"b3e63c542b7a20bcc52718a5a10b7d71de673a4a7542be7913de22da504678bd","text":"第九条（其他费用）本法未规定的费用，应当按实际成本计算。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001197-130808-ko","scope":"BODY","start":666,"end":790,"target_id":"608746698db4d8532a2ab1cc9d80f59f158814b5c9daa8df53be01a0345bc85c","source_hash":"71ca60218ddb2d921b309714ce8bbb30ed904175e8009c230ca37c21a559be0c","text":"第十条（执行和申请案件的费用）\n① 与强制执行和申请案件相关的费用，应当按照前条的规定计算。\n② 在强制执行或申请案件中指定保管人或管理人时，费用由法院确定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001197-130808-ko","scope":"BODY","start":790,"end":1085,"target_id":"786a3c5ef86684f3d4da3beb47f01bc098de8107e81960a9457215ca9a03aaac","source_hash":"c6e62e1b402dfef1dd7904ca2a7bacc92867979b2d0e70994317ff167b2d0dc1","text":"第 10-2 条（第三方债务人的保证金费用）\n① 按照《民事执行法》第248条的规定存入债务金额的第三方债务人，可以向法院申请偿还因存入与扣押生效部分相对应的金额而产生的费用，以及根据该条第4款提交存款报告的费用。\n② 第三方债务人应当按照第1款的规定提出申请，直到提交《民事执行法》第248条第4款规定的存款报告为止。\n③ 第 1 款规定的费用应从与扣押生效部分对应的保证金中支付。\n④ 第1款规定的费用计算标准和支付程序，由最高法院规则确定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001197-130808-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1085,"end":1159,"target_id":"2c777c307e68e0ef30ada1ecf1755d27d748bc82eff34b56a8d1085168e66d92","source_hash":"de72adb0c3c4297b946eda0029dc7eda98fd8a1d08cc831e2455701e7c82eff1","text":"第 11 条（费用支付）证人、专家证人、口译员和笔译员的每日津贴、差旅费、住宿费和其他必要费用，应由法院根据请求支付。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001197-130808-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1159,"end":1355,"target_id":"98f4ffd6ed59ede6d9a3b8a10ef2d238e1c795921ad267b8a36bda49096f5a22","source_hash":"de869f90c87839f868136563fb51b15cd42e1e098874ab0a864239905ba9fce6","text":"第十二条（费用清单）\n① 法院支付当事人未预付的费用时，应当按照一审法院的裁定，向未预付费用的当事人收取费用；或者按照判决，向承担费用的当事人收取费用。该裁定具有与债权人取得债权相同的效力。\n② 前款规定适用于《民事诉讼法》第131条至第133条规定的情形。<2002年1月26日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001197-130808-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1355,"end":1420,"target_id":"63b1ba9a7f751f55150f904f6014b3a17c9ba14ed5605e2bb5000fae685b1e72","source_hash":"429a6befda2b1f2212f5797f0d5f7dc27fb7c2d296880bd0477f0211a8adcd84","text":"第十三条（执行官费用）执行官费用按最高法院规则规定数额收取。<1997年12月13日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001197-130808-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1420,"end":1441,"target_id":"7735c4a773d85d6a02b13e43309d368c01d0c52e656c10c7f07a3ff0853bf745","source_hash":"64f96d3f8ff2f30909a335a68681171dc5ecb9d01cc2f8798b18669ceaec3963","text":"补充规定 <第336号，1954年9月9日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001197-130808-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1441,"end":1480,"target_id":"75b9cda0ad48a690e149a249bca1b6ea1f8a745bdf2e541349827a927296ff89","source_hash":"226c49d8670e400dfacdc5e59265f6751ac3769e36fb4b8047bd084cecaf5d0c","text":"第十四条（生效日期）本法自 4287 年 9 月 1 日起生效（Dangi）。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00018","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001197-130808-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1480,"end":1518,"target_id":"7362f5d3d113c87d1b41fd7009d71a48b8f592ea4f2dfb59e57643999aba89b4","source_hash":"48409ebb7a9745d43232829e066758b1957e62185b5503de3a0250a225106808","text":"第十五条 本法实施前已生效的有关民事诉讼费用的法律法规予以废止。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00019","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001197-130808-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1518,"end":1554,"target_id":"51be080f5190a3e5accdc292665fad7d1495e09ce3ef91812ece65850186cb91","source_hash":"e4152ad9b68b4853582b7eeb477c96340d29a7bf10f052965e6a04397cc8bb1a","text":"第十六条 本法实施前因诉讼程序而产生的费用，适用旧法规定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00020","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001197-130808-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1554,"end":1649,"target_id":"6cf5be1fe11baf3c8d1fd5ed8d669e5fb9f8150cb8a5f4d098952cf4e3ab2feb","source_hash":"c262d7020ecd3e930cabe7f930eeb83fb95ccc38ecae7ec62c8c15e4ed5a6383","text":"第十七条 本法规定的当事人、证人、专家证人、口译员和笔译员的最高每日津贴，以及陆路（非火车）交通费和住宿费，可根据经济情况的变化，由最高法院规则增加或减少。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00021","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001197-130808-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1649,"end":1692,"target_id":"869c3a6aa039da0bef94d36b224942749ddc4f17e84f42f29689ec89b80652c6","source_hash":"ac426fc359fbb18121e9f5a2a6e21c35abfef6b5a762bce6d9c3c099445ba8cc","text":"补充条款 <第1117号，1962年7月31日>\n\n本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00022","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001197-130808-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1692,"end":1736,"target_id":"8bcd00a5fc4485abc5e1d8406e3c804ebe477f5b6d8cf3567fb539acd79809f9","source_hash":"9e4546c970c726517cf51e8d0f20cbaf9cc14fa16262130072eba303c78d5725","text":"补充规定 <第2201号，1970年6月18日>\n\n本法自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00023","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001197-130808-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1736,"end":1821,"target_id":"9298caab001b7e8619364be214a8b8858862e3cf996ce5b8508f6b53d32dbec1","source_hash":"30bd045b780ee749c8bd4e76ed0057c436e68002ac5c7c7647a54f11069d98d9","text":"增补（关于根据政府部门名称等变更修订建筑法等的法案）<1997年12月13日第5454号法案>\n\n本法自1998年1月1日起生效。（但书略）\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00024","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001197-130808-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1821,"end":1870,"target_id":"b49e5d24b7277b54598122aa6c0f3ff5ade280fabc6ca4d7cfd35a81cf9eb149","source_hash":"b2f6fc80bad77a044a63410e65db46e8b892ec33d450c6d527f3cd07dbdbf154","text":"补充规定 <第6629号，2002年1月26日>\n\n本法自2002年7月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00025","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001197-130808-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1870,"end":1908,"target_id":"18606c184da2ba7620d9a3731d811b5d5fb900007979c5caccf5a3b3a42ecff9","source_hash":"6d5e66c65443414fe55a53438d60147fa08c18a7523112d76b64de66c071dcd1","text":"补充条款（印花税法）<第11551号法案，2012年12月18日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00026","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001197-130808-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1908,"end":1946,"target_id":"9ba3391a861c186c6e3c36be1157259fd7b6a3f74b18ac1c00ff31f0940c3a6f","source_hash":"5b7b7ce00ce4ba4c696d6b6cc0d3cd9522eb78f4c0e501bed0ee7129bdb3666a","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起一年后生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00027","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001197-130808-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1946,"end":1998,"target_id":"0e2b1f0a6be1711bc06d9e40c5fc2cd8bfa6848cab29d4a6a251b94fe7d7f0e9","source_hash":"24da0c47b428d1d71ecef0f8d8387e6b3b7661e4014eb04aff965c59c5599bb8","text":"第二条（修改其他法律）① 省略\n\n  ②《民事诉讼费用法》部分修改如下。 \n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00028","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001197-130808-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1998,"end":2035,"target_id":"6c6b8ff7d0b15a61f401072726c4dc3a58c1d28e0d2e571d91a4bc87470235a9","source_hash":"32b3039f46b48f750bd8d28ccd79ecc25608c47181863359330c4395c14f28ac","text":"  第 2 条中的“attached”应改为“attached”。\n\n  ③ 和 ④ 省略"}]}